# 🔴 SECRETS AND PERSONAL DATA MUST NOT ENTER AN IMAGE LAYER.
#
# A layer is not a file you can take back: `docker history` and any registry
# push carry it forever, exactly like a git commit. .env holds live *arr API
# keys, an SMTP app password and a JFA-GO password; data/ holds real message
# history, real phone-number-keyed conversation state and Kindle addresses.
# Neither is needed to BUILD, and both are supplied at RUN time (env_file and a
# bind mount). Keep them out.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
data/
*.log

node_modules/
.git/
.gitignore

# Tests are not shipped in the runtime image (scripts/ IS — it carries
# kindle-verify-live.ts, the delivery-check harness we run inside the container
# to prove the negative control still discriminates after a cutover).
test/

# Host-side supervision and tooling that a container replaces or cannot use.
ecosystem.config.cjs
Dockerfile
docker-compose.yml
.dockerignore
README.md
